{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Applied the initial plan-review advisories before claim. The deterministic first post-window review-bot write is now the rebar.toml re-pin change's own LLM-Review vote, with an explicit change/patchset/timestamp receipt followed by old-tip ancestry and size-pack-growth assertions. Queue emptiness now requires both review-bot /health in_flight == 0 and an authenticated Gerrit query for open current patchsets lacking LLM-Review. Corrected live operational measurements to [operator-attested], normalized the zero-session/MCP criterion label, split reconciler/fsck receipts, and added a distinct [code-verifiable] criterion for the landed mapped enforce_since value. Outcomes were strengthened, not relaxed. Re-review required because plan material changed."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785858497091387001,"uuid":"f1dc47a9-1198-47c9-a352-36ae978c7723"}